 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Some days later in Caesarea town",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The King and his sister arrived now",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To pay their respects to the new governor",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With great pomp they entered the hall of power",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Paul was brought in at the order of Festus",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To speak his defense before the men",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The King gave him permission to speak",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.02,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And Paul stretched out his hand in the end",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This man has done nothing deserving death",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Or imprisonment for the charges laid",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He spoke of light and of the risen Lord",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And they agreed that no guilt was weighed",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I saw a light brighter than the sun",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.98,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Blazing around me on the road to Damascus",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The Lord said I am Jesus whom you persecute",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Arise and stand on your feet, it was said",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I was not disobedient to the vision",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I preached to Damascus and Jerusalem",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.94,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To Israel and the Gentiles alike",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That they should repent and turn to Him",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This man has done nothing deserving death",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Or imprisonment for the charges laid",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He spoke of light and of the risen Lord",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And they agreed that no guilt was weighed",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The King rose up with the governor",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And Bernice and those who were seated",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "As they withdrew they spoke to one another",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With words of truth that they believed",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He could have been set free if he had not appealed",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 1.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To Caesar's court in the end",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  }
 ],
